@Laczen Deprecation process guide demands:
> Code using the deprecated API needs to be modified to remove usage of said API

https://docs.zephyrproject.org/latest/development_process/api_lifecycle.html#deprecated

@Laczen  What about patch to write and erase API implementations?
``` C
static inline int z_impl_flash_write(const struct device *dev, off_t offset,
				     const void *data, size_t len)
{
	const struct flash_driver_api *api =
		(const struct flash_driver_api *)dev->api;
	int rc;

	if (api->write_protection != NULL) {
		rc = api->write_protection(dev, false);
		if (rc) {
			return rc;
		}
	}

	rc = api->write(dev, offset, data, len);

	if (api->write_protection != NULL) {
		(void)api->write_protection(dev, true);
	}

	return rc;
}
```

